---

<Layout
  title="Dry Lining Cost Guide 2026 | Maidstone & Kent Pricing & Service Guide"
  description="Comprehensive 2026 dry lining cost guide for Maidstone and across Kent. Residential & commercial pricing per m², timeframes, insurance requirements, payment terms, and how to avoid cowboy builders."
  canonical="/resources/dry-lining-cost-guide/"
>
  <main class="container" style="padding: 34px 0 70px;">

    <!-- Schema Markup -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(orgJsonLd)} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleJsonLd)} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceJsonLd)} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqJsonLd)} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbJsonLd)} />

    <!-- Hero Image -->
    <section style="max-width: 860px; margin-bottom: 18px;">
      <div class="card" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
        <img
          src="/images/service-drylining.jpg"
          width="1200"
          height="630"
          alt="Professional dry lining work in a Maidstone residential property showing plasterboard installation"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          style="display:block; width:100%; height:auto;"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Article -->
    <article class="card" style="padding: 28px; max-width: 860px;">

      <!-- Hero Title -->
      <header style="margin-bottom: 22px;">
        <h1 style="margin:0 0 10px; font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px); line-height: 1.15;">
          The 2026 Guide to Dry Lining Costs and Services in Kent
        </h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); font-size: 16px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">
          The most comprehensive pricing and service guide for dry lining, plastering, partitioning, and ceilings in Maidstone and across Kent. Updated September 2026 with live trade data, regional cost indices, and verified contractor quotes.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- TL;DR -->
      <section style="background: rgba(30,64,175,0.05); border-left: 4px solid var(--primary); padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; margin-bottom: 28px;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 18px;">TL;DR — Quick Reference</h2>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;">
          <li><strong>Residential dry lining:</strong> £28 – £50 per m² (walls); £30 – £52 per m² (ceilings)</li>
          <li><strong>Commercial dry lining:</strong> £25 – £45 per m² (economies of scale)</li>
          <li><strong>Metal stud partitioning:</strong> £55 – £100 per linear metre (single-layer)</li>
          <li><strong>Suspended ceilings:</strong> £33 – £60 per m² (flat designs)</li>
          <li><strong>Plastering:</strong> £22 – £38 per m² (skim coat); £30 – £50 per m² (full re-plaster)</li>
          <li><strong>Rendering:</strong> £45 – £72 per m² (sand &amp; cement); £88 – £135 per m² (silicone)</li>
          <li><strong>Maidstone vs national:</strong> 10% – 15% above UK average for labour</li>
          <li><strong>Single room:</strong> 1 – 2 days | <strong>Whole house:</strong> 1 – 2 weeks | <strong>Commercial fit-out:</strong> 2 – 4 weeks</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 1: Residential Costs -->
      <section style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
        <h2 id="residential-costs" style="font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Cost Per Square Metre — Residential</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          Residential dry lining costs in Maidstone and across Kent vary by board type, finish level, and access. The figures below include materials and labour. Maidstone prices are broadly in line with the UK national average. The Kent region typically runs a few per cent below the London-weighted national figure rather than above.
        </p>
        <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
          <table style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="background: rgba(245,251,249,0.9);">
                <th style="border:1px solid var(--border); padding:10px; text-align:left;">Type of Work</th>
                <th style="border:1px solid var(--border); padding:10px; text-align:left;">Typical Cost per m²</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {residentialCosts.map((row) => (
                <tr>
                  <td style="border:1px solid var(--border); padding:10px;">{row.service}</td>
                  <td style="border:1px solid var(--border); padding:10px; font-weight:650;">{row.cost}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
          <strong>Note:</strong> A typical 3-bedroom house dry lining project in Maidstone ranges from £4,000 to £8,500 depending on finish level, insulation requirements, and whether ceilings are included. Single rooms (small bedroom) typically cost £600 – £1,400.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Commercial Costs -->
      <section style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
        <h2 id="commercial-costs" style="font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Cost Per Square Metre — Commercial</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          Commercial dry lining benefits from economies of scale. Larger projects, repeat specifications, and open-plan spaces reduce per-m² costs. Fire-rated and acoustic specifications are more common in commercial work across Maidstone's business districts and retail parks.
        </p>
        <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
          <table style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="background: rgba(245,251,249,0.9);">
                <th style="border:1px solid var(--border); padding:10px; text-align:left;">Type of Work</th>
                <th style="border:1px solid var(--border); padding:10px; text-align:left;">Typical Cost per m²</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {commercialCosts.map((row) => (
                <tr>
                  <td style="border:1px solid var(--border); padding:10px;">{row.service}</td>
                  <td style="border:1px solid var(--border); padding:10px; font-weight:650;">{row.cost}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
          <strong>Note:</strong> Commercial office fit-outs of 500 – 1,000 m² in Maidstone typically range from £18,000 to £45,000 depending on partition complexity, ceiling type, and whether fire-stopping and acoustic treatment are required.
        </p>
      </section>

